0081: 
0082: // The krun (llvm) main module: MPY plus the concrete-only legs (keyed sort's
0083: // real key calls, deep list equality). Verification builds import MPY and
0084: // never see MPY-CONCRETE. The llvm kompile MUST use --main-module MPY-KRUN —
0085: // with plain MPY the concrete legs are silently absent (this was live for a
0086: // while: sorted-key stuck and comprehension asserted wrong under krun).
0087: module MPY-KRUN
0088:   imports MPY
0089:   imports MPY-CONCRETE
0090: endmodule

