+The 22 supplied opaque/no-evaluator symbols are `md5hexCodes`; `sortVS` and
+`sortKeyVS`; and the float helpers `intFloatDiv`, `divII`, `floatMod`,
+`floatLt`, `absF`, `subF`, `divF`, `addF`, `mulF`, `powF`, `gtF`, `eqF`,
